## Tutorials

Add up all digits (e.g., 352: 3 + 5 + 2 = 10):

Explanation:We usen % 10to extract the last digit, add it to the sum, and then remove the digit withn /= 10.

### Code Examples

```
Example
int n = 352;
int sum = 0;

while (n > 0) {
  sum += n % 10;
  n /= 10;
}

System.out.println("Sum of digits: " + sum);
